  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nIn my use case I'm creating a matrix room and store the returned room id into a database. In case something goes wrong while storing the room id into the database – or somewhere else – I'm left with a dangling matrix room.\r\n\r\nIf synapse would support database-like transactions I could create the room, store the room id and only after successfully storing it, commit the room creation transaction.\r\n",
